        "explanation": "<h4><b>Vocabulary Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>A <b>knock-on effect</b> refers to a situation in which an event or action causes other events to happen indirectly, creating a chain reaction of secondary consequences.</p></div><div class=\"english_choice_explanation\"><p><b>(Choice A)</b> is correct…"
