          "text": "• **Inversion**: Omit 'if' and invert the subject and auxiliary verb:\n  - Present/Future: *Were they to study harder, they would pass.*\n  - Past: *Had we known about the storm, we would have stayed home.*\n  - Future/Possible: *Should you need help, please call me.*\n\n• **Alternative Words**:\n  - *But for* + noun/gerund = If it weren't/hadn't been for...\n  - *Provided (that)* / *As long as* = Only if...\n  - *Supposing* / *Assuming* = Imagine if..."
