        "explanation": "<h4><b>Grammar Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>The verb <b>'mind'</b> is regular, so its past simple form is <b>'minded'</b>. The idiom is structured as <b>[subject] + [mind] + [possessive adjective] + [manners]</b> without any intervening prepositions.</p></div><div class=\"english_choice_explanation…"
