        "explanation": "<h4><b>Vocabulary Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>The idiom <b>\"haul someone over the coals\"</b> is used to describe a situation where someone is spoken to angrily or criticized severely because they did something wrong.</p></div><div class=\"english_choice_explanation\"><p><b>(Choice C)</b> is correct…"
