        "hint": "Consider why a writer would want to present an opponent's argument in a clear, logical way.",
        "explanation": "<h4><b>Writing Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>A well-structured body paragraph discussing an opposing viewpoint should not just state the view, but also explain its reasoning and outcomes. This creates a <b>fair and logical presentation</b> of the counter-argument, which makes the writer's subsequen…"
