        "explanation": "<h4><b>Writing Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>An argumentative essay discussing multiple viewpoints must follow a balanced structure: introducing the topic and preference, dedicating separate body paragraphs to discuss the chosen viewpoints fairly, and concluding with a summary that reinforces the s…"
