        "explanation": "<h4><b>Vocabulary Rule:</b></h4><div class=\"english_grammar_rule\"><p>The noun phrase <b>\"a pat on the back\"</b> functions as a singular countable noun meaning an act of praise or congratulations.</p></div><div class=\"english_choice_explanation\"><p><b>(Choice B)</b> is correct because \"pat\" is the only word that colloca…"
